---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Testimonial from '../components/Testimonial.astro';
---
<Base title="About Vinny O'Brien — E-commerce Consultant & Analyst" description="Meet Vinny O'Brien: e-commerce operator, consultant and analyst working across Ireland, Europe, the UK and North America." type="AboutPage">
  <main class="wrap page">
    <p class="kicker">The person behind the neon</p>
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="bio">
      <figure>
        <img src="/brand/vinny-nrf.jpg" alt="Vinny O'Brien speaking at NRF in New York" width="733" height="1100" />
        <figcaption>NRF, New York. The jetlag is load-bearing.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div>
        <p>The V Spot Network is written and produced by Vinny O'Brien: an e-commerce operator and consultant with 15+ years in the industry, including eBay and retail, and experience advising established brands across Ireland, the UK, Europe and North America.</p>
        <p>Through <strong>Vinny &amp; Co Consulting</strong>, Vinny helps commerce teams improve operations, assess practical AI and automation opportunities, and move important projects from idea to delivery. He also works with commerce SaaS teams on market analysis and operator-focused insight.</p>
        <p>The house position: technology should amplify empathy, not just strip out friction. Some friction is the product. This gets argued at length in the essays and at slightly less length on the shows.</p>
        <p>The house frameworks: Friction as Currency, the THOUGHT/COMMERCIAL grid, and a cross-Atlantic lens that reads EU commerce through a North American frame and vice versa. Based in Tralee, County Kerry. Frequently in New York. Permanently between time zones.</p>
        <p>Vinny is a public speaker and available for events worldwide, conference lanyards a speciality.</p>
        <p><a href="/consulting/">Explore e-commerce AI and operations consulting →</a></p>
        <p class="muted">Consulting enquiries: <a href="https://vinnyandco.com">Vinny &amp; Co on Substack</a> · <a href="/book/">Book a call</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="recommendation"><Testimonial full /></div>
  </main>
</Base>
